        "authority_effect": "Use a root-only orris-tincture-like formulation role without asserting literal tincture extraction."
      },
      {
        "text": "dry",
        "authority_effect": "The user-authoritative formulation role is dry rather than buttery, creamy, cosmetic, or lipsticky."
